    "implementation_delta": "Add SourceSealAndSupervisorBaseline@1 to record the exact current-head portfolio and the three source-authority repositories, hash the immutable bootstrap inputs, content-address scheduler policies, and inventory the fourteen shared contracts as a baseline that is not a freeze. Recursive sibling submodules are not source authority. Gitlink mismatch without an explicit isolated-source binding is typed blocked. Missing origin/main or repositories stay typed unavailable. Simulated cleanliness cannot mint a seal. The evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome. This nested commit, once admitted, changes the Accelerate source seal and requires a fresh inventory for later qualification."
  },
